","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/navigationBarTitle(_:displayMode:)-78iko":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/navigationBarTitle(_:displayMode:)-78iko","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"navigationBarTitle(_:displayMode:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"navigationBarTitle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"displayMode","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NavigationBarItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI17NavigationBarItemV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"TitleDisplayMode","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI17NavigationBarItemV16TitleDisplayModeO"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"deprecated":true,"url":"\/documentation\